@startuml
title Combined Composition Flow – Manual, Assisted, Guided Paths

actor User as U

' Entry points
participant "ManualWorkspace" as MW
participant "AssistedWorkspace" as AW
participant "GuidedWorkspace" as GW

' Shared modules
participant "SeedGenerator\n(Mood / Progression / Inspire)" as SG
participant "GuidedDecisionEngine" as GDE
participant "ProgressionGenerationRequest" as PGR
participant "ProgressionAnalysis" as PA
participant "PairingEngine" as PE
participant "Strategy\n(Lift / Resolve / Contrast / Continue)" as STRAT
participant "ChordSuggestionEngine" as CSE
participant "GeneratedProgression" as GP

== Entry Point Selection ==
U -> MW : Manual Path\n(User selects chords)
U -> AW : Assisted Path\n(User selects Mood / Pattern / Inspire)
U -> GW : Guided Path\n(User selects intention / section / role)

== Manual Path ==
MW -> PGR : Build request with raw chords

== Assisted Path ==
AW -> SG : Request assisted seed
SG --> AW : Return seed progression
AW -> PGR : Build request with assisted seed

== Guided Path (Proposed) ==
GW -> GDE : Request guidance\n(intention → section → role)
GDE --> GW : Provide contextual options
GW -> SG : Request contextual seed
SG --> GW : Return guided seed
GW -> PGR : Build request with guided seed

== Convergence: Key Inference ==
PGR -> PA : Analyse progression\n(determine key, functions,\nstability, tension, cadence)
PA --> PGR : Return key-aware analysis

note right of PA
KEY IS DETERMINED HERE
All paths converge at this point.
end note

== Strategy Routing ==
PGR -> PE : Request strategy\n(using stability + tension)
PE --> STRAT : Select strategy

== Phrase Generation ==
loop For each chord in continuation
    STRAT -> CSE : suggest(key, lastChord)
    CSE --> STRAT : ranked diatonic suggestions
    STRAT -> STRAT : filter by function\n(DOM/PD/TONIC)
    STRAT -> STRAT : choose chord\n(variantIndex, unused pool)
end loop

STRAT --> GP : Build GeneratedProgression
GP --> U : Display continuation

== Guided Path Loop ==
U -> GW : Choose next section / intention
GW -> GDE : Continue guided composition

@enduml
